@* The handbook for Samordnare (FR-117): Del B on its own. Its own page rather than a role check
   inside /handbok, because FR-104 enforces authorisation per page and never by hiding parts of a
   shared page. Open to both roles, like /listor, so an Administratör can see exactly what a
   coordinator sees. Static SSR — see Handbook.razor. *@
@page "/handbok/samordnare"
@layout AdminLayout
@attribute [Authorize(Roles = AdminRoles.Both)]

<PageTitle>Handbok — Åkerögården Admin</PageTitle>

<AdminHeader Title="Handbok" />

<div class="handbook">
    <HandbookCoordinatorPart />
</div>
